      "content": "thanks for this. it looks okay, but the QC tool just flagged it for \"low complexity.\" it gave it a pretty low score because there aren't enough sections or points to satisfy the metric.\n\ncan you expand it a bit? maybe break down the setup or the safety stuff into more granular steps or headings so it hits a higher score? just make sure it's still readable—i don't want the techs to get confused, but we really need that complexity score to be higher so it clears the system.",
